quran[13]{c,v,t}:
  43,61,"Indeed, he (Jesus) will be (the sign for) the knowledge of the Hour (when his second coming takes place). So do not doubt it, and follow me. This is a straight path."
  43,62,"And do not let Satan bar you (from the path of Allah). Indeed, he is your manifest enemy."
  43,63,"And when ‘Isa (Jesus) came with clear proofs, he said: ‘I have indeed brought you wisdom, and (I have come) to make clear to you some of the things you differ about. So be God-conscious and obey me."
  43,64,"Allah is indeed my Lord and your Lord, so worship Him (alone). This is a straight path.’"
  43,65,But the factions differed among themselves. So woe to the wrongdoers for the punishment of a painful day!
  43,66,Are they waiting for anything except that the Hour should come upon them suddenly while they are unaware?
  43,67,Friends on that Day will be one another’s enemies except for the God-conscious.
  43,68,"(They will be told:) ‘O My servants! There is no fear for you today, nor shall you grieve.’"
  43,69,(They are) those who believed in Our revelations and fully submitted (to Us).
  43,70,"(The angels will say:) ‘Enter Paradise, you and your spouses (or close companions); you will be honoured and pleased.’"
  43,71,Golden trays and bowls will be passed around them. And there will be whatever the souls desire and the eyes find pleasing. And you will remain there forever.
  43,72,"That is Paradise, which you are made to inherit for what you used to do."
  43,73,There will be abundant fruits for you from which you will eat.
